@@ -1,8 +1,15 @@
-# The only dependencies are the pinned GitHub actions in .github/workflows/;
-# Dependabot proposes a new major tag once a week.
+# The only dependencies are the GitHub actions in .github/workflows/, each
+# pinned to a full commit with its version in a comment beside it, so a tag
+# moved upstream changes nothing here until a pull request says so.
+# Dependabot reads the comment, proposes the newer commit and version once a
+# week, and groups every action into one pull request, since the pins move
+# with each release of an action and one pull request a week is one review.
